  eventID: MechanicalPostInteraction
  dialogueLines:
  - You already broke it. Why bother messing with it now?
  - "It\u2019s already broken. There\u2019s really no point in touching it anymore."
  - "You\u2019ve already damaged it. What more are you hoping to accomplish?"
  - The machine is broken. Maybe leave it alone now.
  - "You already broke the thing. Surely that\u2019s enough messing around."
  - "It\u2019s not working anymore. Why keep trying to interact with it?"
  - "The machine has already been broken. There\u2019s nothing left to do with it."
  - "You\u2019ve already broken it. I\u2019m not sure what you expect to happen now."
  - "It\u2019s completely broken. Perhaps stop poking at it."
  - You broke it already. Continuing to mess with it is just wasting time.
